module SKUIFontTest;

// A minimal variable TrueType font (636 bytes) built for these tests, with
// units per em 1000 and one axis "wght" from 100 to 900 (default 400):
// - avar maps the normalized values -1 -> -1, 0 -> 0, 0.5 -> 0.25, 1 -> 1;
// - glyph 1 'A' is the square (100, 0) (500, 0) (500, 500) (100, 500),
//   advance 600, left side bearing 100;
// - gvar for glyph 1 has two tuples:
//   * peak wght = +1: dx = +100 for points 1, 2 and 5 (point 5 is the
//     second phantom point, which sets the advance); the other points get
//     inferred deltas;
//   * peak wght = -1: dx = -50 for all 8 points (outline and phantoms);
// - HVAR gives glyph 1 an advance delta of +100 at wght +1, -50 at -1.
// The expected values below are derived by hand from the specification.
